{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dismal Dreams is a relentless RPG, where the judgement of daylight is all but gone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/trash_heap.png?t=1743479498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide a troubled <strong>Sammy Fraud</strong> and happy go lucky\u00a0<strong>William Peacher</strong> through an uncaring and hostile world, it may take a few attempts.\u00a0Rummage and explore through what's left of\u00a0civilization in it's thrown together district; the Dam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/your_entire_party.gif?t=1743479498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make use of anything</strong> you can find to protect yourself, however unusual. Each weapon comes with it's own unique skillset/playstyle, no senseless killing and grinding to unlock new skills. Even something mundane like a mop or a flashlight have their own distinct purpose in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/Enemy_Platter.png?t=1743479498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be prepared for anything</strong>, every encounter in the game is unique and presents a different challenge beyond higher stats. No two enemies share the same attack. Pick your battles wisely, you're not a bloodthirsty monster, you're a survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3367930?t=1743479498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/42f8e44336c1207686577e29c8fafae71e2d3291/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743479498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/c07909e05cb8fd93e6783ff148a9b77ca675c729/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743479498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/c07909e05cb8fd93e6783ff148a9b77ca675c729/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743479498","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence on minors\r\nMinors inflicting violence\r\nMinors using drugs\r\nEmotional and Physical child abuse\r\nDepictions of suicide\r\nVomit with noise\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dismal Dreams is a relentless RPG, where the judgement of daylight is all but gone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/trash_heap.png?t=1743479498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide a troubled <strong>Sammy Fraud</strong> and happy go lucky\u00a0<strong>William Peacher</strong> through an uncaring and hostile world, it may take a few attempts.\u00a0Rummage and explore through what's left of\u00a0civilization in it's thrown together district; the Dam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/your_entire_party.gif?t=1743479498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make use of anything</strong> you can find to protect yourself, however unusual. Each weapon comes with it's own unique skillset/playstyle, no senseless killing and grinding to unlock new skills. Even something mundane like a mop or a flashlight have their own distinct purpose in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/Enemy_Platter.png?t=1743479498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be prepared for anything</strong>, every encounter in the game is unique and presents a different challenge beyond higher stats. No two enemies share the same attack. Pick your battles wisely, you're not a bloodthirsty monster, you're a survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Logan Crossley"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/a8fd126f3964ca95ab47d6b2cb7bc2dbce810ba3/header.jpg?t=1743479498","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.6.8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 2400 or comparable<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115763,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115763/movie480.mp4?t=1743479497","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115763/movie_max.mp4?t=1743479497"},"name":"Dad will be here soon","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115763/9c205ae4ce45471210f7a659e5961b7c347717ba/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743479497","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115763/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743479497","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115763/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743479497"}}],"name":"Dismal Dreams","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae XP / Vista / 7 (32-bit/64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Pentium\u00ae 4 2.0 GHz equivalent or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1024 x 768 pixels or higher desktop resolution<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":tr